Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We introduce CAST, which improves robot skills while keeping the original\Npolicy as a reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This matters because the critic can misjudge which actions are better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As orange shows, even small updates can drift away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,CAST pulls back, as green shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So we keep the original policy fixed and learn a correction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Each action keeps its own reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here’s one learning step.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We first sample paired actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, the critic proposes an improvement. We normalize, cap, and scale its\Ngradient.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We also pull toward the base,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,with a stronger pull beyond the reference radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We combine these arrows and cap the target step around the current action.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We then fit the correction to these fixed targets,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and repeat the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The policy now learns to match the fixed green targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We refresh them and repeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,while the soft pull leaves room to improve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We test this approach in LIBERO, robomimic, and DMC, covering manipulation\Nand continuous control.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.00,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,On robomimic square, CAST reaches ninety percent success using thirty-eight\Npercent fewer environment steps than DICE-RL.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,On five LIBERO tasks, updates with no controls or clipping alone have zero\Nsuccess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,CAST improves every task over the base, although radial restoration alone is\Nbetter on two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.00,0:01:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, we guide improvement, limit each target step,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and keep the original skill as a reference.
